        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Human exploitation of the ocean operates across multiple stressors simultaneously:\noverfishing, habitat destruction, pollution, climate change, and deep-sea mining.\nNo ocean ecosystem is unaffected. The compounding effect of multiple stressors —\nwarming + acidification + deoxygenation — creates synergistic damage that models based\non single stressors systematically underestimate."
